{%- comment -%} Check if we have mapped content for this collection {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign has_mapped_content = false -%}
{%- capture handles -%}emerald,blue-sapphire,opal,ruby,yellow-sapphire,white-sapphire,red-coral,pearl,hessonite,cats-eye,amethyst,citrine,turquoise,navratana,upratnas,surya,chandra,mangal,budh,shukra,guru,shani,rahu,ketu,iolite,garnet,peridot,tourmaline,white-coral,agate,chalcedony,pitambari,aquamarine,natural-zircon,moonstone,lapis-lazuli,malachite,sphatik,blue-topaz,tiger-eye,purple-sapphire,padparadscha,star-sapphire,peach-sapphire{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign handle_list = handles | split: ',' -%}
{%- for handle in handle_list -%}
  {%- if gem_handle == handle -%}
    {%- assign has_mapped_content = true -%}
    {%- break -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Curated merchandising collections (Sanctum, Sacred Essentials, Beyond Nine,
  Strand Edit, Crushworthy Delights) have no per-gem editorial content.
  They use a separate set of placeholder tabs instead of the gem tabs.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign is_curated_nocontent = false -%}
{%- assign curated_nocontent_handles = 'sanctum,sacred-essentials,beyond-nine,strand-edit,crush-worthy-delights,crushworthy-delights' | split: ',' -%}
{%- for handle in curated_nocontent_handles -%}
  {%- if collection.handle == handle -%}
    {%- assign is_curated_nocontent = true -%}
    {%- break -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- assign is_collection_overview = false -%}
{%- if collection.handle == 'navratana'
    or collection.handle == 'upratnas'
    or collection.handle == 'sanctum'
    or collection.handle == 'sacred-essentials'
    or collection.handle == 'beyond-nine'
    or collection.handle == 'strand-edit'
    or collection.handle == 'crush-worthy-delights'
    or collection.handle == 'crushworthy-delights' -%}
  {%- assign is_collection_overview = true -%}
{%- endif -%}

<!-- Breadcrumb — above hero -->
<div class="cht-breadcrumb">
  <div class="page-width">
    <nav class="cht-breadcrumb__nav" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="cht-breadcrumb__link">Home</a>
      <span class="cht-breadcrumb__sep">|</span>
      {%- if collection.handle == 'ruby'
        or collection.handle == 'emerald'
        or collection.handle == 'blue-sapphire'
        or collection.handle == 'yellow-sapphire'
        or collection.handle == 'white-sapphire'
        or collection.handle == 'pearl'
        or collection.handle == 'red-coral'
        or collection.handle == 'hessonite'
        or collection.handle == 'cateye'
      -%}
        <a href="/collections/navratana" class="cht-breadcrumb__link">Navratna</a>
        <span class="cht-breadcrumb__sep">|</span>
      {%- elsif collection.handle == 'opal'
        or collection.handle == 'amethyst'
        or collection.handle == 'citrine'
        or collection.handle == 'iolite'
        or collection.handle == 'garnet'
        or collection.handle == 'turquoise'
        or collection.handle == 'peridot'
        or collection.handle == 'tourmaline'
        or collection.handle == 'white-coral'
        or collection.handle == 'agate'
        or collection.handle == 'chalcedony'
        or collection.handle == 'pitambari'
        or collection.handle == 'aquamarine'
        or collection.handle == 'natural-zircon'
        or collection.handle == 'moonstone'
        or collection.handle == 'lapis-lazuli'
        or collection.handle == 'malachite'
        or collection.handle == 'sphatik'
        or collection.handle == 'blue-topaz'
        or collection.handle == 'tiger-eye'
      -%}
        <a href="/collections/upratnas" class="cht-breadcrumb__link">Upratnas</a>
        <span class="cht-breadcrumb__sep">|</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      <span class="cht-breadcrumb__current">{{ collection.title }}</span>
    </nav>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="collection-hero-tabs" id="CollectionHeroTabs-{{ section.id }}">
  <!-- 1. Split Hero Section -->
  <div class="collection-hero">
    <div class="collection-hero__lifestyle">
      {%- if collection.image -%}
        <img src="{{ collection.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}" alt="{{ collection.title }}" loading="lazy">
      {%- elsif collection.handle == 'opal' -%}
        <img src="{{ 'opal.png' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ collection.title }}" loading="lazy">
      {%- else -%}
        <img src="{{ 'collection-default-page.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Gemstone collection placeholder" loading="lazy">
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="collection-hero__info">
      <div class="collection-hero__info-inner">
        {%- assign _icon_asset = 'nav-' | append: collection.handle | append: '.png' -%}

        {%- if _is_planet_page -%}
        {%- render 'planet-summary', planet_handle: collection.handle -%}
        {%- else -%}

        {%- if gem_welcome_name != blank -%}
          <h1 class="collection-hero__welcome">Welcome to the World of {{ gem_welcome_name }}</h1>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if hero_tagline != blank -%}
          <p class="collection-hero__tagline">{{ hero_tagline }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- case gem_handle -%}
          {%- when 'emerald' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In deep green, the mind slows, and thought begins to move with ease.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>पन्ना — शांत स्पष्टता</strong><br>यह चमकता नहीं, मन को स्थिर करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'blue-sapphire' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">Blue Sapphire does not rush — it anchors. In its quiet blue, discipline settles, and strength learns to stay.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>नीलम — जहाँ गहराई स्थिरता बनती है</strong><br>नीलम चमकता नहीं — जीवन को स्थिर करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'opal' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">Opal is not one shade, but movement held in light. In its shifting glow, softness returns, and balance finds its rhythm.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>दूधिया पत्थर — जहाँ रंग साँस लेते हैं</strong><br>यह एक रंग नहीं, चलती हुई रोशनी है।</p>
          {%- when 'ruby' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">Ruby does not simply shine — it ignites. In its deep red, confidence awakens, and direction becomes clear.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>माणिक — आत्मविश्वास की अग्नि</strong><br>यह चमकता नहीं, भीतर की शक्ति को जगाता है।</p>
          {%- when 'yellow-sapphire' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its warm gold, clarity unfolds, and wisdom finds direction.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>पुखराज — मार्गदर्शन का प्रकाश</strong><br>यह चकाचौंध नहीं करता, सही दिशा दिखाता है।</p>
          {%- when 'white-sapphire' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its quiet clarity, balance forms, and harmony finds its place.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>सफ़ेद पुखराज — शांत संतुलन</strong><br>यह चमकता नहीं, जीवन को संतुलित करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'red-coral' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its grounded red, strength settles, and courage finds direction.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>लाल मूंगा — संतुलित शक्ति</strong><br>यह उग्र नहीं, शक्ति को स्थिर करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'pearl' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its soft glow, the mind settles, and stillness finds its place.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>मोती — शांत मन का प्रकाश</strong><br>यह चमकता नहीं, मन को स्थिर करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'hessonite' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its grounded glow, illusion fades, and direction begins to form.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>गोमेद — स्पष्टता की अग्नि</strong><br>यह भ्रम नहीं बढ़ाता, सत्य को सामने लाता है।</p>
          {%- when 'cats-eye' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">Not colour — but a single line of attention. In its moving light, distraction fades, and clarity sharpens.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>लेहसुनिया — एकाग्र दृष्टि</strong><br>यह रंग नहीं, ध्यान की रेखा है।</p>
          {%- when 'amethyst' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its quiet violet, the mind slows, and thought begins to settle.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>जमुनिया — शांत संतुलन</strong><br>यह चमकता नहीं, मन को ठहराव देता है।</p>
          {%- when 'citrine' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its warm glow, confidence rises, and growth finds its pace.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>सुनहला — सौम्य विकास का प्रकाश</strong><br>यह चमकता नहीं, जीवन को आगे बढ़ाता है।</p>
          {%- when 'turquoise' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its gentle blue, calm settles, and protection feels close.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>फिरोज़ा — शांत सहारा</strong><br>यह भारी नहीं, मन को सुकून देता है।</p>
          {%- when 'lapis-lazuli' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its quiet depth, thought slows, and understanding begins to settle.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>लाजवर्द — गहराई का नील</strong><br>यह चमकता नहीं, मन को भीतर ले जाता है।</p>
          {%- when 'tourmaline' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its shifting hues, balance settles, and the mind finds ease.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>टूरमलीन — भावों का संतुलन</strong><br>यह एक रंग नहीं, मन के स्वरों का विस्तार है।</p>
          {%- when 'aquamarine' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its calm blue, the mind softens, and expression finds ease.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>एक्वामरीन — सहज स्पष्टता</strong><br>यह दबाव नहीं बनाता, मन को शांत करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'pitambari' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its dual light, growth steadies, and discipline finds direction.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>पीताम्बरी नीलम — संतुलित प्रगति</strong><br>यह दबाव नहीं बनाता, विकास को संतुलित करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'purple-sapphire' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its quiet depth, intensity softens, and clarity takes a more composed form.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>बैंगनी नीलम — संयमित शक्ति</strong><br>यह उग्र नहीं, शांत और गहरा है।</p>
          {%- when 'padparadscha' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its soft glow, harmony settles, and beauty finds balance.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>पद्मराग — संतुलित सौंदर्य</strong><br>यह दिखावा नहीं करता, संतुलन में चमकता है।</p>
          {%- when 'white-coral' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its soft form, energy calms, and strength turns steady.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>सफेद मूंगा — शांत शक्ति</strong><br>यह उग्र नहीं, जीवन को सुकून देता है।</p>
          {%- when 'moonstone' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its soft glow, intuition deepens, and the mind finds its quieter knowing.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>चंद्रकांत मणि — भावों का दर्पण</strong><br>यह चमकता नहीं, मन को शांत करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'malachite' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its layered green, old patterns soften, and space for renewal opens.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>मैलेकाइट — गहराई का हरा</strong><br>यह चमकता नहीं, मन को भीतर से नया करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'sphatik' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its pure form, intention holds clear, and stillness becomes its own answer.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>स्फटिक — शुद्ध स्पष्टता</strong><br>रंग नहीं, शुद्धता इसकी पहचान है।</p>
          {%- when 'blue-topaz' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its clear light, the mind opens, and expression finds its steadier register.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>नीला पुखराज — खुली स्पष्टता</strong><br>यह चमकता नहीं, मन को शांत और स्पष्ट करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'iolite' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its shifting blue, direction emerges, and the inner compass steadies.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>आयोलाइट — गहरी दिशा</strong><br>यह चमकता नहीं, मन को धीरे-धीरे स्पष्ट करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'natural-zircon' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its clear light, brilliance arrives without effort — natural, effortless, and alive.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>जरकन — सहज चमक</strong><br>दिखावा नहीं, स्वाभाविक सौंदर्य।</p>
          {%- when 'star-sapphire' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its quiet surface, a star appears, and stillness begins to move.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>स्टार नीलम — भीतर का तारा</strong><br>यह बाहर नहीं चमकता, भीतर से उजाला देता है।</p>
          {%- when 'peach-sapphire' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its soft tones, ease settles, and balance feels natural.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>पीच सैफायर — सहज संतुलन</strong><br>यह ध्यान नहीं मांगता, मन को स्थिर करता है।</p>
          {%- when 'garnet' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its varied hues, depth gathers, and presence holds steady.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description collection-hero__description--hindi"><strong>गार्नेट — गहरे रंगों का परिवार</strong><br>यह एक नहीं, कई रूपों में स्थिर रहता है।</p>
          {%- when 'peridot' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its fresh green, the mind renews, and a lighter clarity begins to form.</p>
          {%- when 'tiger-eye' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its golden band, courage holds steady, and the eye stays clear.</p>
          {%- when 'agate' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its quiet layers, stability forms, and grounding arrives without force.</p>
          {%- when 'chalcedony' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">In its soft light, communication eases, and emotional steadiness takes shape.</p>
          {%- when 'navratana' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">The nine gemstones of Navratna represent the nine <em>grahas</em> of Vedic astrology — each governing a distinct force of life. When worn together, they are believed to create balance, protection, and harmony, ensuring that no single planetary influence dominates the others.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description">Navratna is chosen not for emphasis, but for equilibrium. It brings the system into alignment — strengthening what is weak, softening what is excessive, and allowing life to move forward with steadiness and composure.</p>
            <p class="collection-hero__description" style="font-style:italic;color:#6b5c3e;">Move gently through the nine. The whole works when each is respected.</p>
          {%- when 'upratnas' -%}
            <p class="collection-hero__description">The Upratnas are the secondary gemstones of Vedic astrology — each one aligned with a planetary force, each one chosen when a gentler or more accessible remedy is needed. Certified, natural, and held to the same standard as every stone in our collection.</p>
          {%- else -%}
            {%- if collection.description != blank -%}
              <p class="collection-hero__description">{{ collection.description | truncatewords: 400 }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
        {%- endcase -%}

        {%- if benefits != blank -%}
          {%- assign benefit_lines = benefits | split: '\n' -%}
          <ul class="collection-hero__benefits">
            {%- for line in benefit_lines -%}
              {%- if line != blank -%}
                <li>→&nbsp; {{ line }}</li>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

